WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.986
You've been staring at that fire for an hour.

00:00:02.986 --> 00:00:05.972
I'm thinking of improving it.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:07.972
It's a fireplace, Voss.

00:00:07.972 --> 00:00:08.959
It doesn't need improvement.

00:00:08.959 --> 00:00:12.666
Improving? That's exactly what the last
innkeeper said.
